<h1>Held rule drafts, version 30</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Version 30. Six landed changes wait for the curator&rsquo;s reading, items 80 to 85: the passages where the landing of drafts 43 to 65 changed the approved words. Two proposed changes wait for the curator&rsquo;s yes, in ten drafts, 70 to 79: a question has one home; and each line of the held list names its exit.</p>
</header>

