<section id="s2" class="part">
<h2>Proposed changes</h2>
<p>These two changes come from the review of the process&rsquo;s dead ends of 23 November 2026. Each waits for the curator&rsquo;s yes to its exact words. A comment on an item, or a word in chat, answers it.</p>

<section id="g3" class="part group">
